# SYNTHETIC (hand-made). A held repeat chord must not swallow or act on cooked runes
# of other keys: only the swallowed key's own rune counts as a tick.
defaults
# hold Mod+l, type x: x is forwarded in k and c, no extra focus-column-right
k F868
k F868 6C
c 6C
k F868 6C 78
c 78
c 78
K F868 6C
c 6C
K F868
K
# hold Mod+l, type Shift+x: X forwarded, no action
k F868
k F868 6C
c 6C
k F868 6C F016
k F868 6C F016 78
c 58
K F868 6C F016
K F868 6C
K F868
K
# Mod+Shift+r: the shifted cooked R of the swallowed key is still swallowed
k F868
k F868 F016
k F868 F016 72
c 52
c 52
K F868 F016
K F868
K
